OL,3,GNEWSADad who hates sand to take on
OL,4,ASahara trek
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dad who hates sand is trekking the
OL,7,FSahara Desert to raise money for the
OL,8,Fhospice that cares for his son.
OL,10,FAndrew Privett, from Leyland in
OL,11,FLancashire, is one of 31 adventurers
OL,12,Fwho are preparing to trek 30 miles
OL,13,F(48km) across Morocco's Erg Chegaga
OL,14,FDunes over six days in November.
OL,16,FThey will face extreme temperatures,
OL,17,Fchallenging terrain and long days
OL,18,Fbeneath the desert sun, in the first
OL,19,Foverseas challenge for Chorley's Derian
OL,20,FHouse Children's Hospice.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
