OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADad who hates sand to take on
OL,4,ASahara trek
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrew, whose 12-year-old son Jacob is
OL,7,Fsupported by the charity, said: "I'm
OL,8,Fnot a great fan of sand, so the Sahara
OL,9,Fshould be one of the last places I want
OL,10,Fto go, but I've been up and down
OL,11,FLytham's sand dunes during summer so I
OL,12,Fcan get some practice."
